<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA SHAREHOLDER LIST FOR MARCH 25.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA SHAREHOLDER LIST FOR MARCH 25.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central depository said on</p>
<p>Friday that 16.632 million Unibanka shares have been</p>
<p>blocked ahead of its shareholder meeting on March 25.</p>
<p>Some 3.281 million shares were not blocked ahead of the</p>
<p>March 13 deadline. The shares have to be blocked for</p>
<p>shareholders to take part in the meeting.</p>
<p>Unibanka's total share capital is 19.914 million shares.</p>
<p>The depository gave a list of the biggest shareholders,</p>
<p>controlling in total some 16.632 million shares.</p>
<p>						    percent stake</p>
<p>    Latvian Privatisation agency		33.33</p>
<p>    EBRD						20.09</p>
<p>    Swedfund Financial Markets AB		7.53</p>
<p>    Hansabank					  5.76</p>
<p>    bin Ibrahim Al-Ibrahim Sheikh Majid	5.62</p>
<p>    Pareks Banka				     3.41</p>
<p>    Openheimer &amp; Co				  1.12</p>
<p>    Baltic Fund ILP				  1.07</p>
<p>    Amiel Financial Services		     1.03</p>
<p>    Latvijas Zemes Bank			    0.70</p>
<p>    Others (hold less than 0.50 percent)     3.86</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
